---
// components/Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden bg-surface">
  <!-- Dynamic Background elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] bg-accent-blue/10 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[20%] right-[-5%] w-[30%] h-[30%] bg-brand-pink/40 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-deep-blue/5 border border-deep-blue/10 mb-8 animate-fade-in text-sm font-medium text-deep-blue">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-orange animate-pulse"></span>
      Capacité limitée : 3 nouveaux clients ce mois-ci
    </div>

    <!-- Headline: Promesse Principale -->
    <h1 class="font-display text-hero tracking-tight text-deep-tech mb-6 leading-tight animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
      Récupérez 5 à 10h par semaine <br class="hidden lg:block"/> sans changer vos outils.
    </h1>

    <!-- Subheadline -->
    <p class="text-sub text-text-secondary mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
      Le premier système d'automatisation IA sur mesure pour les dirigeants d'ESN. Éradiquez la charge administrative et le chaos des emails en 15 jours.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
      <a href="https://taap.it/gflux-audit" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-brand-orange hover:bg-brand-orange-hover text-white rounded-full font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-glow hover:shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-1">
        Réserver un audit gratuit
      </a>
      <a href="#systeme" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-white hover:bg-surface-alt text-deep-tech border border-gray-200 rounded-full font-semibold text-lg transition-all shadow-sm">
        Comment ça marche ?
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Micro-réassurance -->
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
      ✓ Garantie de résultat&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;✓ Hébergement en France&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;✓ Accompagnement humain
    </p>

    <!-- Visual / Workflow snippet -->
    <div class="mt-16 relative max-w-5xl mx-auto animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 border-t border-white/60">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white shadow-soft rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-2xl">
            🌪️
          </div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-deep-tech text-sm">Boîte Surchargée</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1">Capture de l'email important noyé dans la masse</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Arrow -->
        <div class="hidden md:block text-gray-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-deep-blue to-accent-blue shadow-glow rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-2xl">
            🧠
          </div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-deep-tech text-sm">Analyse & Brouillon</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1">L'IA extrait les infos et prépare le travail</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Arrow -->
        <div class="hidden md:block text-gray-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white shadow-soft rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-2xl">
            ✅
          </div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-deep-tech text-sm">Validation en 1 clic</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1">Vous contrôlez, le système met à jour vos outils</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
